{"id":"vod_sn_36966","vodId":"36966","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"魔人侦探食脑奈罗","name_cn":"魔人侦探食脑奈罗","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/1cb301763dff6cda91f30bbbc3990fea.jpg"},"summary":"人世间存在着大大小小的谜团，当这些谜团被解开之时会释放出或强或弱的能量，食脑奈罗（子安武人 配音）就是专门食用这些能量的魔族，当魔界再无可以解开的谜团之后，他来到了人世，只为了寻找那能够满足他的极致的谜团。　　桂木弥子（植田佳奈 配音）是一名拥有着悲惨过去的高中女生，她的父亲死于非命，然而凶手至今未被找到。命运让充满了谜团的弥子和憧憬着谜团的奈罗相遇了，在奈罗的帮助下，弥子终于解开了事件的真相。之后，奈罗和弥子开设了魔界侦探事务所，弥子虽为名誉上的所长，但真正运转侦探社，解开谜题的却是拥有着恐怖魔人力量的奈罗，两人联手解开了一系列匪夷所思的案件，使得黑暗的人性在光天化日之下无处遁形。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:47:39","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aGG6vBbW9T1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VUjvz2EaEg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mtKiexkRPS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bUMwGTEksS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dC2pNX6xQE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CCKcgRcDMu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3RWSXqJnCN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gqvehU2SX01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cdK3MnxQsP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BhZYVntNSB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9UWSA7CKfM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/L0Kpff40gv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZEX3Ki1fTm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fNzzGCwZdm1/video/index.m3u8"}